WEBVTT

00:00:00.564 --> 00:00:05.434
Yume kara samete mo
Even if I wake from my dreams

00:00:06.464 --> 00:00:11.934
Kono te wo nobasu yo
I'll reach my hand out to you

00:00:23.454 --> 00:00:28.724
Onaji tsuyosa de yobi au
If our hearts can reach each other

00:00:29.454 --> 00:00:34.084
Kokoro ni nareru no naraba
with the same strength

00:00:35.334 --> 00:00:40.594
Nanninbun no kizu demo
Then I would be able to bare

00:00:41.134 --> 00:00:46.264
Boku wa uketome rareru yo
The pain of many hearts

00:00:46.674 --> 00:00:50.204
Mousukoshi datte kiga surun da
I can feel that it will arrive soon

00:00:50.284 --> 00:00:55.214
Kono kabe ga kuzureru
When these walls will be torn down

00:00:56.014 --> 00:01:00.424
Reimei
The dawn

00:01:02.154 --> 00:01:08.114
Yume kara samete mo
mada minai yume no houmade
Even if we wake from our dreams
We'll have to keep running

00:01:08.194 --> 00:01:14.104
Bokura wa hitori de
hashiri tuzukeru shika nain da
Towards our unrevealed dreams

00:01:14.174 --> 00:01:20.734
Korogari mayotte tsukuri dasu
boku no inryoku ga
The gravity by my painful journey
will draw me

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:26.954
Itsuka kimi e
To you one day

00:01:53.574 --> 00:01:57.944
A far away memory

00:01:58.614 --> 00:02:02.884
Is painted on the water's surface

00:02:03.784 --> 00:02:12.354
Floating between the jade-like waves

00:02:14.164 --> 00:02:18.724
My body goes down deep

00:02:19.164 --> 00:02:24.164
Where it can't be reached,

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:33.474
Bending, drowning, swaying into the depths

00:02:34.384 --> 00:02:39.514
In a dream before I was born

00:02:39.584 --> 00:02:44.544
The place that I swam to

00:02:44.794 --> 00:02:49.824
Did not have anything

00:02:49.894 --> 00:02:54.354
But was still full of everything

00:02:54.704 --> 00:03:05.634
Where the shore was woven into light

00:04:49.884 --> 00:04:51.084
Well...

00:05:00.264 --> 00:05:01.524
Hey!

00:05:49.474 --> 00:05:52.204
You're still such an
adolescent, aren't you?

00:05:55.154 --> 00:05:56.644
What are you going to do next?

00:05:57.054 --> 00:05:59.314
Run away with a stolen bike?

00:06:02.594 --> 00:06:05.284
If you don't like being
doubted, then log out.

00:06:06.594 --> 00:06:08.654
And if you still don't
like it, then quit.

00:06:08.734 --> 00:06:11.424
After all, it's just
a game. Am I wrong?

00:06:16.504 --> 00:06:19.774
Maybe we can't
trust Haseo anymore.

00:06:21.014 --> 00:06:21.874
Teacher?

00:06:23.374 --> 00:06:27.544
But I have my teacher, Sakisaka!

00:06:29.654 --> 00:06:30.514
Are you listening?

00:06:30.684 --> 00:06:31.154
Huh?

00:06:31.384 --> 00:06:32.284
Uh, yeah...

00:06:32.554 --> 00:06:34.114
You're acting strange.

00:06:34.324 --> 00:06:35.294
What do you mean?

00:06:36.924 --> 00:06:38.084
Are you going, too?

00:06:41.294 --> 00:06:42.764
W-Where?

00:06:42.864 --> 00:06:44.234
To watch the meteor shower!

00:06:44.304 --> 00:06:44.824
Huh?

00:06:46.534 --> 00:06:48.474
It was on this morning's news.

00:06:48.534 --> 00:06:50.764
It only happens once every
few decades or something.

00:06:51.044 --> 00:06:53.334
Anyway, there are going to
be a lot of shooting stars!

00:06:53.874 --> 00:06:54.364
Huh?

00:06:55.814 --> 00:06:57.004
You don't know about it?

00:06:57.184 --> 00:06:58.804
Uh, yeah...

00:06:58.884 --> 00:07:01.944
Tsk. Tsk. That's not very good.

00:07:02.254 --> 00:07:04.714
Pay attention to the
Eastern sky tonight.

00:07:06.184 --> 00:07:10.784
I won't see anything from
my bachelor apartment.

00:07:24.144 --> 00:07:28.734
Well, I'm going to log out after I
tell them about the mission today.

00:07:29.514 --> 00:07:30.134
Sure.

00:07:30.614 --> 00:07:31.634
Thanks for everything.

00:07:33.284 --> 00:07:36.684
The doctor at the hospital says
my recovery is going smoothly.

00:07:37.384 --> 00:07:39.874
But I still have a long road ahead.

00:07:40.324 --> 00:07:41.154
I see.

00:07:42.894 --> 00:07:47.354
I'll give this mission
to Tabby and Sakisaka.

00:07:47.834 --> 00:07:50.664
You know, Haseo is
being difficult.

00:07:50.734 --> 00:07:52.094
So, for now...

00:07:52.164 --> 00:07:53.264
I'll leave it up to you.

00:08:05.544 --> 00:08:06.514
Thank you.

00:08:10.584 --> 00:08:11.554
All right.

00:08:11.824 --> 00:08:12.984
Now...

00:08:13.524 --> 00:08:14.754
Working again?

00:08:15.494 --> 00:08:17.984
For goodness sake, you
never take a break.

00:08:19.364 --> 00:08:22.384
I'll try to prick the weak corner.

00:08:22.834 --> 00:08:24.354
Well, see ya.

00:08:26.364 --> 00:08:27.634
Prick?

00:08:30.774 --> 00:08:32.534
More like "slash"!

00:08:34.044 --> 00:08:36.014
If you've been falsely accused...

00:08:36.074 --> 00:08:40.244
...you need to prove
it on your own.

00:08:42.314 --> 00:08:44.044
Otherwise...

00:08:49.894 --> 00:08:54.554
...you could log out for today,
relax and watch the stars.

00:08:55.464 --> 00:08:56.364
Stars?

00:08:56.664 --> 00:08:57.724
You don't know?

00:08:57.864 --> 00:09:00.264
Tonight you can see
the meteor shower.

00:09:02.734 --> 00:09:04.004
I'm not interested.

00:09:07.104 --> 00:09:10.844
If I can see the stars,
I'll let you know, okay?

00:09:11.244 --> 00:09:13.074
I don't care.

00:09:13.214 --> 00:09:14.584
I'll let you know.

00:09:15.084 --> 00:09:16.574
Whatever.

00:09:20.424 --> 00:09:23.444
Man, we have to go
treasure hunting again?

00:09:23.694 --> 00:09:25.164
Shino's calling us!

00:09:25.224 --> 00:09:25.994
Let's go!

00:09:31.434 --> 00:09:33.454
What are you doing, teacher?

00:09:33.564 --> 00:09:35.164
You're going to be left behind.

00:09:35.834 --> 00:09:39.104
Man, what bad timing.

00:09:39.674 --> 00:09:42.434
Sorry Tabby, I'll go later.

00:09:42.514 --> 00:09:43.774
You go on ahead.

00:09:44.244 --> 00:09:45.834
Hey, wait...!

00:10:06.334 --> 00:10:08.094
Oh! That was quick!

00:10:10.074 --> 00:10:12.194
Well, sit down.

00:10:12.704 --> 00:10:14.264
What do you want?

00:10:15.314 --> 00:10:17.374
So, what are you going to do?

00:10:18.444 --> 00:10:21.044
Are you going to join me or not?

00:10:23.314 --> 00:10:24.984
Haseo and I...

00:10:25.254 --> 00:10:27.814
Which one of us is
it that you need?

00:10:27.894 --> 00:10:30.354
I'm the one that
asked the question.

00:10:30.894 --> 00:10:31.824
Just answer.

00:10:32.264 --> 00:10:34.284
It's not that easy, boy.

00:10:35.264 --> 00:10:39.294
If I came across two gems on the
ground, which one would I pick?

00:10:41.934 --> 00:10:45.104
I'd take both, of course!

00:10:45.674 --> 00:10:48.164
Don't you have any business sense?

00:10:48.714 --> 00:10:50.304
Business, huh?

00:10:50.784 --> 00:10:52.504
Think about it very carefully.

00:10:53.884 --> 00:10:55.044
But, you know...

00:10:57.114 --> 00:11:00.174
It only took one email
to get you out here.

00:11:00.454 --> 00:11:03.014
You came to see me
of your own accord.

00:11:03.754 --> 00:11:05.224
Did you know...

00:11:05.364 --> 00:11:07.924
...that you can see a
meteor shower tonight?

00:11:08.664 --> 00:11:11.494
Huh? You're talking
about the real world?

00:11:12.004 --> 00:11:14.524
That has no value.

00:11:14.604 --> 00:11:18.194
I don't have time
for things like that.

00:11:18.744 --> 00:11:19.834
I see.

00:11:22.944 --> 00:11:24.934
What? No way.

00:11:25.414 --> 00:11:26.174
I'm sorry.

00:11:26.314 --> 00:11:27.574
Hi!

00:11:27.654 --> 00:11:29.914
Hey! You're late, teacher!

00:11:32.484 --> 00:11:35.284
Haseo won't be
joining this mission.

00:11:35.354 --> 00:11:37.324
That doesn't matter to me.

00:11:37.694 --> 00:11:39.184
It doesn't matter if he's not here.

00:11:39.264 --> 00:11:41.094
If teacher's here, we'll be all right.

00:11:41.234 --> 00:11:41.824
Right?

00:11:42.534 --> 00:11:44.794
So, what are we
supposed to do here?

00:11:45.404 --> 00:11:48.994
Today we'll target the fields
other than the Lost Ground.

00:11:49.504 --> 00:11:52.444
So even in a regular place
like this dungeon...

00:11:52.504 --> 00:11:55.534
