can find the Virus Core.

00:11:55.774 --> 00:11:57.404
Virus! Virus!

00:11:57.714 --> 00:11:59.374
I'm going to find one!

00:12:04.124 --> 00:12:04.744
Teacher?

00:12:05.884 --> 00:12:07.114
Oh, uh, alright...

00:12:07.694 --> 00:12:09.454
