00:12:22.434 --> 00:12:24.704
Oh, I know! I understand!

00:12:25.044 --> 00:12:27.564
The real Shino must be
beautiful and nice, too!

00:12:27.644 --> 00:12:30.444
Of course, the men of the
world can't leave you alone!

00:12:30.614 --> 00:12:31.704
It's not like that.

00:12:31.784 --> 00:12:32.834
Don't worry!

00:12:32.914 --> 00:12:34.814
Just leave this to teacher and me.

00:12:34.884 --> 00:12:37.214
You go enjoy your date!

00:12:37.524 --> 00:12:39.354
Okay, let's go teacher!

00:12:39.624 --> 00:12:41.414
Hey, stop calling me that!

00:12:41.494 --> 00:12:43.894
Huh? Why can't I call
you that, teacher?

00:12:44.724 --> 00:12:45.784
How about brother Sakisaka?

00:12:45.864 --> 00:12:47.224
Not that, either!

00:12:52.004 --> 00:12:55.964
Well, we'll be able to
see the stars soon.

00:12:57.374 --> 00:12:58.304
Are you logging out?

00:12:58.374 --> 00:13:02.704
Of course, I haven't seen a
meteor shower since I was a kid.

00:13:03.614 --> 00:13:05.134
Bye for now.

00:13:05.844 --> 00:13:06.714
I see.

00:13:12.084 --> 00:13:15.784
